    <li>
      <!-- The gun ring and its guns (D'thorga Vehicles 0.121.0, Framework 0.296.0; vehicle-militarised-service-vehicles.md, MV8; the owner's guns by role of 19 Nov 2026, and the weapons block of 25 Nov 2026). Weights the design's; costs and work authored [A]. The ring seats a gunner who works the hand-swung guns; the remote weapon station needs the ring too, and no gunner. -->
      <key>PhobosGunRing</key>
      <label>Gun ring</label>
